Syntax: aura absolution

The Aura of Absolution represents the highest calling of the divine warrior,
channeling the healing power of the gods to protect and restore allies in
battle. A deikhan projecting this aura becomes a beacon of restorative light.

While projecting this aura, the deikhan periodically calls upon divine favor
to heal wounds, salve damaged limbs, clot bleeding injuries, and purge poisons
from affected party members. The aura emanates a gentle warmth as it works,
providing comfort even in the darkest battles.

The aura's effects are automatic and occur randomly during combat, prioritizing
the most severely injured or afflicted party members. The healing provided
rivals that of dedicated clerics, making the projecting deikhan invaluable
for sustained combat operations.

Only one aura may be projected at a time. Activating a new aura replaces any
currently active projection. The aura affects all group members in the same
room as the deikhan.

